 "notes": "Addresses name the island; ISO 3166-2:CV lists 22 municipalities and 2 island groups. ISO municipality codes are used for the 5 islands that are a single municipality (BV, BR, MA, SL, SV). The 4 islands with several municipalities have no ISO code and keep non-ISO codes: Fogo (CV-CF, MO, SF), Santiago (CV-CA, CR, PR, RS, SD, SM, SO, SS, TA), Santo Antão (CV-PA, PN, RG), São Nicolau (CV-RB, TS)."
